    rv64 m7 device: preserve shape-graph correctness and failed22G composed gate [D]
    
    Five ON and one OFF complete requests match every M6 artifact byte; both
    sessions fail the22GiB native composition admission.34 actual executable
    updates across91 assignments,10 GPU poisoning/update cases pass. No latency
    win or graph default promotion is claimed. Preserve exact frozenroot source
    overrides and build/parity/failure evidence.

